&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Custom&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Teams features + pooled usage, SCIM, audit logs, priority support&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
